          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Who I Am</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Executive-style coaching for sustainable wellbeing — habits, frameworks, measurable outcomes.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#0b6;--muted:#6b7280;--bg:#fff;--text:#0b1720}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial; color:var(--text); background:var(--bg); margin:0}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    header.hero{display:flex;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:38px 0}\\n    .hero-copy{flex:1}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#042; border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .card-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:28px}\\n    .card{background:#f8fff9;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    section{margin-top:48px}\\n    h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 12px}\\n    .methods ul{padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;background:#fbfff9;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .lead-magnet form{display:flex;gap:8px}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin:72px 0 30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* subtle visual motif */\\n    .pattern{opacity:0.06;position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;width:160px;height:160px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Voices</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-title\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-copy\\\">\\n        <h1 id=\\\"hero-title\\\">Strategic wellbeing for high-performing lives</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I’m {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}). I help busy professionals convert intentions into reliable habits — without burnout. We focus on outcomes you can measure in weeks, not vague promises.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card-row\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Outcome focus</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Tangible metrics and weekly checkpoints.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Habit-first</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Micro-actions that compound.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\"><strong>Executive lens</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Practical frameworks tailored to leaders.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- inline unique hero svg (assets/img/hero.svg equivalent) -->\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e6fff2\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#dfffe6\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" rx=\\\"28\\\"></rect>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"70\\\" r=\\\"26\\\" fill=\\\"#bff7d7\\\"/>\\n        <rect x=\\\"100\\\" y=\\\"110\\\" width=\\\"66\\\" height=\\\"26\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#c9f9e0\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"values\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"values-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"values-title\\\">Principles that guide our work</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Clear, measurable progress. Habits designed around real schedules. Practices that fit a professional life.</p>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><strong>Clarity over busyness:</strong> pick 3 levers that move the needle.</li>\\n        <li><strong>Systems over willpower:</strong> design environments that support choices.</li>\\n        <li><strong>Accountability with compassion:</strong> steady feedback, no harshness.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"methods\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"methods-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"methods-title\\\">How I work — a concise framework</h2>\\n      <ol>\\n        <li><strong>Discover:</strong> map routines and barriers in a 45-minute intake.</li>\\n        <li><strong>Design:</strong> three-month habit architecture with weekly focus.\\n        <li><strong>Deliver:</strong> 1:1 coaching, micro-assignments, and adjustable metrics.</li>\\n      </ol>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"objections\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"obj-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"obj-title\\\">Common hesitations I address</h2>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><strong>I don’t have time:</strong> we reallocate 60 minutes of low-impact activity into scalable habits.</li>\\n        <li><strong>What about long-term change?</strong> the plan is built around maintenance from day 1.</li>\\n        <li><strong>I’ve tried coaching before:</strong> this is pragmatic, metric-driven coaching — not another check-in.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"testimonials\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"test-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"test-title\\\">Stories of measurable change</h2>\\n      <blockquote>\\\"In 10 weeks I reclaimed my mornings and added two hours of deep work per week.\\\" — Senior Director, {{CITY}}</blockquote>\\n      <blockquote>\\\"The habit framework stopped my cycle of starting and stopping. Real results.\\\" — VP of Product</blockquote>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"lead-title\\\">\\n      <svg width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 56 56\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#e9fff3\\\"></rect>\\n        <path d=\\\"M16 30h24M16 22h24\\\" stroke=\\\"#0b6\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 id=\\\"lead-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:15px\\\">Free 7-day Habit Planner</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">A concise planner to start and sustain one habit in a week.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:auto\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@company.com\\\" aria-label=\\\"email\\\" required style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #e6efe8;border-radius:8px\\\">\\n        <button type=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px 12px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:8px;border:none;color:#042;font-weight:700\\\">Send</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"contact-cta\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"cta-title\\\">\\n      <h2 id=\\\"cta-title\\\">Ready to redesign one week of your life?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Start with a 30-minute clarity conversation. We’ll outline your first month and deliver your first habit playbook.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule a call</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Offerings</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Structured coaching services focused on habits, leadership wellbeing and sustainable energy management.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#0b6;--muted:#7a7f88;--bg:#fff;--text:#04202a}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;margin:0;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:24px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{margin-right:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    h1{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:28px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .service-list{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    .service{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:#f7fffb}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .methods{margin-top:18px}\\n    .objections{margin-top:18px;background:#fbfffb;padding:14px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .lead form{display:flex;gap:8px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#042;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:40px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <nav>\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n        </nav>\\n        <h1>What I deliver — targeted services</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Short engagements and ongoing support for professionals and teams.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <!-- inline avatar svg (assets/img/avatar.svg equivalent) -->\\n      <svg width=\\\"84\\\" height=\\\"84\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 84 84\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"84\\\" height=\\\"84\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#eafff3\\\"></rect>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"42\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"14\\\" fill=\\\"#cffaeb\\\"></circle>\\n        <path d=\\\"M18 66c6-10 42-10 48 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#bff2d6\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <section class=\\\"service-list\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"svc-title\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"svc-title\\\">Individual services</h2>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <strong>Monthly Momentum (retainer)</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Weekly 1:1s, weekly check-ins, habit tracker, flexible agenda.</div>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\">Ideal for leaders who want steady progress and the option to pivot priorities each month.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <strong>Intensive Sprint (4 weeks)</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Three focused sessions + daily micro-assignments.</div>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\">Fast setup and immediate habit installation around one priority.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <strong>Team Resilience Workshop</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Half-day session plus follow-up action plan.</div>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\">For small leadership teams wanting a shared framework to protect energy and decision capacity.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"methods\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"how-title\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"how-title\\\">Working method — clear slices</h2>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Baseline audit (schedule & energy map)</li>\\n            <li>Priority selection (3-lever rule)</li>\\n            <li>Weekly rituals + accountability checkpoints</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"objections\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"svc-obj\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"svc-obj\\\">Will this disrupt my calendar?</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">No. Sessions are scheduled to protect core work blocks. Assignments are intentionally small and high-leverage.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"testimonials\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"svc-test\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"svc-test\\\">Client notes</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"The Monthly Momentum removed decision fatigue and gave me back mental bandwidth.\\\" — Director</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#f6fff8;padding:16px;border-radius:10px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Quick consult — 30 minutes</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A focused planning call to decide the right offering for you.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;background:#fffbe9;padding:14px;border-radius:10px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Lead magnet</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Download: \\\"Daily Focus Blueprint\\\" — a one-page template for prioritizing work and wellbeing.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required style=\\\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #efeeda;border-radius:8px;width:100%\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;margin-top:8px\\\">Get the Blueprint</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong>Common question</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">How soon will I notice change? Most clients see measurable shifts in 3–6 weeks when they do the work consistently.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <h3>Still unsure?</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">Most people worry it will feel like extra work. My role is to translate goals into fewer, clearer actions that reduce friction.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start with clarity</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"programs.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Paths</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Structured programs: foundations, growth and transformation built around habits and leadership energy.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#0b6;--muted:#6f7780;--bg:#fff;--text:#052426}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;margin:0;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg)}\\n    .page{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:24px}\\n    nav{margin-bottom:18px}\\n    nav a{margin-right:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    h1{margin:6px 0;font-size:22px}\\n    .program-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .prog{background:#f8fff9;padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .price{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-top:8px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:20px;background:#fbfff9;padding:14px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:22px;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:#f6fff7}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#042;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"page\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Programs — clear timelines, rigorous outcomes</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Choose the path that fits your urgency and bandwidth.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <!-- inline pattern svg (assets/img/pattern.svg equivalent) -->\\n      <svg width=\\\"72\\\" height=\\\"72\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"100\\\" height=\\\"100\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#e9fff4\\\"></rect>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#cffaeb\\\">\\n          <circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"8\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" r=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n          <rect x=\\\"40\\\" y=\\\"10\\\" width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"program-grid\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"prog-title\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"prog\\\" id=\\\"foundations\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:16px\\\">Foundations (8 weeks)</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">Lay the groundwork: energy map, three core habits and an accountability plan.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: Starter plan — a single payment or two installments.</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Apply to Foundations</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"prog\\\" id=\\\"momentum\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:16px\\\">Momentum (12 weeks)</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">Sustained growth: weekly coaching, habit bundling, systems integration.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: Monthly subscription or 3-month package.</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Join Momentum</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"prog\\\" id=\\\"transform\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;font-size:16px\\\">Transform (6 months)</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">Deep change: leadership wellbeing, legacy habits, preventive architecture for decision fatigue.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: Retainer with prioritized scheduling and priority access.</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Explore Transform</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq-title\\\">Program questions</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>How is progress measured?</strong> Specific weekly indicators tied to your priorities — experience, time in focus, energy ratings.</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Can I switch tracks mid-program?</strong> Yes. Each program includes a planning checkpoint to realign goals.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"lead-title\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4 id=\\\"lead-title\\\" style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Free resource: One-week Habit Starter</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">A practical starter you can use immediately to test a new habit over seven days.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n        <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@company.com\\\" required style=\\\"padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6efe8\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get it</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3>Objections I anticipate</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"I don’t want more tasks.\\\" These programs reduce friction by replacing low-impact tasks with high-leverage routines.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Talk with me</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
